1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Remember our big friends?

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,980
Two numbers that make ten together, like five and five.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:10,040
They help when the ones rod has no room to add, or not enough to take away!

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,400
Time for a friendly speed drill!

5
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,280
Drill one, eighteen plus seven!

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,340
No room to add seven.

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,500
Friend time, same as always!

8
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,320
Seven's friend is three!

9
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,120
Take away three, then add ten!

10
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,840
Eighteen plus seven is twenty-five!

11
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:30,460
Check!

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:35,500
Drill two, a take-away this time, eighty-two take away four!

13
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:36,680
Not enough.

14
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:37,460
Friend!

15
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:42,020
Four's friend is six!

16
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,660
Add six, then take away ten!

17
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,820
Eighty-two take away four is seventy-eight!

18
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:48,480
Check!

19
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:53,500
Drill three, take-away again, seventy-five take away eight!

20
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:54,740
Not enough.

21
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:55,820
Friend, quick!

22
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:00,240
Eight's friend is two!

23
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,820
Add two, then take away ten!

24
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,220
Seventy-five take away eight is sixty-seven!

25
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:06,820
Check!

26
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,980
Last drill, back to adding, eighty-eight plus two!

27
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,540
Still no room.

28
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,700
One more friend!

29
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,060
Two's friend is eight!

30
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,760
Take away eight, then add ten!

31
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:23,280
Eighty-eight plus two is ninety!

32
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:25,280
Full check, no misses!

33
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,280
Drill complete, Blaze and Spark are ready for anything.

34
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:34,020
Keep sharp with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
